   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I asked the question here <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/28429063/deploying-shiny-app-written-as-function\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/28429063/deploying-shiny-app-written-as-function&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363913549000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jgJ6aO_hS1l3wSLwg1DZS\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/28429063/deploying-shiny-app-written-as-function</a></div><div>To restate:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">I wrote a Shiny application as a function (</span><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/function.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(12,101,165);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/function.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363913549000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3h1STX1uoV7FvjDemqquUq\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/function.html</a><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">). What&#39;s the best way do deploy it (e.g. to shinyapps)? It seems that </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">deployApp</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> in &quot;shinyapps&quot; package only works for apps written in </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">ui.R</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> and </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">server.R</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> files.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Thanks in advance!</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Michal</span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "wWL6-e-YU2MJ",
   "from": "Winston Chang",
