nly works for apps written in </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">ui.R</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> and </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">server.R</code><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> files.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Thanks in advance!</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Best,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Michal</span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
